                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a8fb4fd7-4047-430d-9533-6d9d7d637adc",
                                "sense_id": "3728ae2b-57a1-38cb-a0e6-419e19de4e5f",
                                "text": "По вы́ходе отца́ своего́, она́ до́лго ещё принаря́живалась и жема́нилась пе́ред небольши́м в оловя́нных ра́мках зе́ркалом и не могла́ налюбова́ться собо́ю.",
                                "translation": "When her father was gone, Oxana remained for a long time decking herself, and coquetting before a small looking-glass, framed in tin. She could not tire of admiring her own likeness in the glass.",
                                "english": "When her father was gone, Oxana remained for a long time decking herself, and coquetting before a small looking-glass, framed in tin. She could not tire of admiring her own likeness in the glass."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
